{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00398","headline":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 中宫助祭升坛 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 中宫助祭升坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坤元光至德，柔训阐皇风。\n芣苡芳声远，螽斯美化隆。\n睿范超千载，嘉猷备六宫。\n肃恭陪盛典，钦若荐禋宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}